WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.367
-Sadie, you're an actor

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:04.133
and part of your craft is making

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:05.767
all kinds of sounds

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.501
and, you know, for the things...

00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:08.567
-Sure.
-...so I thought it'd be fun

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.267
for us to make some sounds
right now.

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:11.801
It is time
for the Mimic Challenge.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.100
Here we go.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.300
[ Cheering and applause ]
-♪ Mimic Challenge ♪

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.400
♪ Mimic, mimic ♪

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.601
♪ Challenge, yeah ♪

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:21.167
-Now, how it works is we're
going to take turns

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:23.033
making noises
with different objects, okay?

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.734
And the other person has
to immediately match

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.801
that sound
as precisely as they can.

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.634
Sound okay? Don't look.
Are you ready?

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.501
I will make
the first noise for you.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:31.701
Here we go. Ready?
-Oh.

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:32.734
-Okay.

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.167
Sadie, make --
make this sound.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:35.834
I don't know if I can do this.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:36.501
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:37.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:38.834
-Can I do this?

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.567
Pbbbbbbbt!

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.067
-Khhhhhhh!

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.400
[ Laughter ]
-Wow! That's not bad.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.634
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Ding ]

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:50.667
[ Rimshot ]
That's pretty good.
-Yeah.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.767
-Alright, now,
this is my turn to mimic.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.701
-Okay.
-This is this.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:58.033
-Oh.
Alright, Jimmy.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.701
-Mm-hmm.
-Make this sound

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:01.400
[ Mooing ]

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.801
One more time?
-It's a lot longer
than you'd think.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.033
[ Mooing ]

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:08.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.767
Hurrrrrrrrrrrrr!

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:10.834
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Yeah.

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:12.300
That's like on pitch.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.767
[ Rimshot ]
-Not bad. On pitch?
-Yeah.

00:01:13.767 --> 00:01:14.534
Look at you.

00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:16.367
-Alright.
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:19.300
Sadie...
-Oh. No. [ Laughs ]

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.234
Make this sound.

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.634
[ Chipmunk squeaking ]

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:24.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.067
-Whah whah whah whah whah whah
whah whah whah whah.

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:28.200
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]
It's kind of --

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.701
You know, it sounds like a cat.

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:30.868
I was ready for that.

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:31.934
-Oh? Good, yeah.
-Yeah, mm-hmm.

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:34.033
-That was perfect
and also on pitch.

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:35.534
Alright, this one.

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:36.467
Alright, let me see
if I can get this one.

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:37.567
-Oh.
-Oh.

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:38.701
-Hm.

00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:39.367
Okay.

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:40.033
[ Honk ]

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.267
-Okay.
[ Honk honk ]

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.200
Alright.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.033
Give it to me one more time.

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:46.634
[ Honk ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.634 --> 00:01:47.400
[ Braying ]
Huahhh!

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:50.234
[ Rimshot ]
-Yes! Yes.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:51.334
[ Ding ]
-[ Brays ] Huahh! It's, like,

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:53.067
a little breathy.
-Hunnh! That was great.

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:54.767
-It was a little breathy.
-Okay.

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:56.834
-Alright. Alright.
How about this?

00:01:56.834 --> 00:02:01.100
This is a text message.
-Oh.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.567
[ Cellphone bloops ]

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:05.567
-Oooh-errr!
Oooh-errr!

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.133
-[ Laughs ]
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:08.467
-Oooh-errr!

00:02:08.467 --> 00:02:12.000
-Alright. Is this -- This is --
-Oh. I have -- Okay.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.968
-Spreading butter on toast?
-Oh. Alright, Jimmy.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.100
Make this sound.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.467
Maybe it will catch -- Yeah.

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.200
[ Butter knife scraping ]

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.901
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:26.901
[ Scraping echoes ]
-No, I'm sorry.

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:27.901
-That's cheating.
-I'm sorry. No, no, no.

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:29.000
You can't do that.
You want more?

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.467
-Yeah, I want to hear it.
-You want more?

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:32.734
[ Butter knife scraping ]

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:36.133
-Khhrrrr! Khhrrrr! Khhrrrr!
-Oh. Oh, yes.

00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:37.300
[ Bell dings ]
Yes.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.534
[ Applause ]
-Was is it too --

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:39.767
-Very nice.
-Was it so realistic?

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:41.400
-It was so good.
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.934
-Whoa! Whoa!
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:44.000
I am so embarrassed.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.067
Okay.
-Great. Two minutes.

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.367
This is the --
-Take the toast.

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:47.634
Thank you very much.
Yes, I got the toast.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.100
This is the last round here.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:52.067
This one is for you.
Here we go.

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:55.434
[ Netflix tone plays ]

00:02:55.434 --> 00:02:58.334
-♪ Da-dunnnn ♪
-♪ Whaaaaa ♪

00:02:58.334 --> 00:02:59.667
[ Bell dings ]
-That's it right there!

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:01.300
That's how the pros do it!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.767
Sadie Sink!

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:05.667
[ Cheers and applause continue ]
"The Whale" is in theaters now.

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:07.367
We'll be right back
with a performance from Dayglow.

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:08.467
Stick around.
[ Cheers and applause ]

